==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*10 [[Cerberus Kids]] (300%) spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
*5 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cerberus Kids]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] (300%) spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**12 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**6 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Fallen Bear]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Having a high Seal is heavily recommended, if not completely mandatory. Because of the presence of the Fallen Bears, a shield piercer such as [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Evil Aku Researcher]] or [[Ancient Egg: N109 (Rare Cat)|Barrel Cat]] will be necessary if you don't want to brute force their shields.

Additionally, as this stage spams surges, proper anti-surge defenses such as [[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|Cat Cactus]] and [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]] help a lot, as does talented [[Matador Cat (Rare Cat)|Bellydancer]]'s chance to dodge every enemy here. Despite not being immune to surges, [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Maize Cat]] can tank these enemies rather well due to sheer bulk.

[[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] shreds this stage with a surge that slows the numerous enemies in this level, a surge immunity, and high damage output.

